## ⚠️ SECURITY: Sensitive config — never commit real secrets
## Real values go in appsettings.Development.json or dotnet user-secrets
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.Staging.json
# Allow only the base template
!appsettings.json

