## ⚠️ SECURITY: Uploaded user files — never in source control
## Students upload PDFs/docs; only the directory structure is committed
CollegeManagement/wwwroot/materials/
wwwroot/materials/

## Keep the placeholder directory (so the folder exists after clone)
!CollegeManagement/wwwroot/materials/.gitkeep
